lastfm.bioSummary:
Jane Air is an alternative rock band from St. Petersburg, Russia formed in 1999 by Sergei Makarov. Originally being a rap metal/nu metal act, their latest releases experimented with other genres from emo to trip-hop.
Band members:
Anton Lissov — vocals;
Sergei Grigoriev — guitar;
Sergei Makarov — bass;
Anton Sagachko — drums.
